# OppChoVec dashboard (copied from C:\These\visu_oppchovec_propre) — mirrors
# that project's own .gitignore policy: the big geodata/export files stay on
# disk (needed for the app to run) but aren't tracked here. Commune_Corse.geojson
# is the one exception — small (264KB) and required by every map.
*.geojson
!stage_ambroise/Données/Commune_Corse.geojson
downloads/*.xlsx
downloads/*.xls
*.zip
